# Run project checks after edits

After changing Python, CI config, or pre-commit config, run the same checks CI runs before you finish:

```bash
ruff check --fix SimplyTransport tests
ruff format SimplyTransport tests
```

If `pre-commit` is available, prefer:

```bash
pre-commit run --files <touched-files>
```

Use the project venv (`./.venv/Scripts/ruff` on Windows, `./.venv/bin/ruff` otherwise) when `ruff` is not on PATH.

Fix every reported issue. Do not leave a task done with a ruff or format failure you introduced.
